  "waived": {
    "search_threads.view": "DIVERGENCE: the official search never returns bodies; ours does when no view is named, because the frozen Hartwell floor scripts read bodies from search results. Named views (THREAD_VIEW_MINIMAL, THREAD_VIEW_METADATA_ONLY) behave exactly as documented. Tracked for removal once those scripts hydrate through get_thread."
